@startuml fig2_activity
!include _style.iuml
title Figure 2. Audit Lifecycle Activity Diagram (ingestion to graduation or retention)

|External Feeds / AI Engine|
start
:Scheduled pipeline job ingests utility,
LTO, telecom and LandBank records
(seed_db.py -> external_records);
|Regional Director|
:Request assessment
POST /beneficiaries/:id/assess;
|Backend & Database|
if (Active calamity moratorium\nfor the household's municipality?) then (yes)
  :409 CALAMITY_MORATORIUM_ACTIVE
  no flag, no penalty (RA 10121);
  stop
else (no)
endif
if (Kept on the program in the last 180 days?) then (yes)
  :409 RETENTION_COOLDOWN
  no re-flag (DECISION-012);
  stop
else (no)
endif
|External Feeds / AI Engine|
:LightGBM classifies SWDI level
(6 proxy-means features) + SHAP top 3;
|Backend & Database|
:Compute composite risk score S_i =
40 x SWDI gap + 20 power > 200 kWh
+ 15 water > 25 cu.m + 25 postpaid telecom
+ 30 owned 4-wheel vehicle (max 100);
if (S_i >= 70?) then (no)
  :Beneficiary stays ACTIVE_COMPLIANT;
  stop
else (yes)
  :program_status = FLAGGED_FOR_REVIEW
  seal MODEL_FLAG_RAISED block;
endif
|Regional Director|
:Review triage queue, trigger badges
and SHAP explanation;
:Dispatch task with priority, due date
and instructions (POST /tasks/dispatch);
|Backend & Database|
:One transaction: VerificationTask PENDING_DISPATCH,
Beneficiary UNDER_INVESTIGATION,
seal TASK_DISPATCHED block;
|Municipal Link (Tablet)|
:Download assigned tasks to IndexedDB
(GET /tasks/assigned);
repeat
  :Visit household offline: inspect livelihood
  asset (MoveIt / Angkas proof) and LandBank card
  custody, photo hashed with Web Crypto + GPS fix;
  :Back on Wi-Fi the PWA auto-syncs the queued
  report (POST /tasks/:id/submit);
  |Backend & Database|
repeat while (Photo SHA-256 matches and\nGPS within 250 m of residence?) is (no: 422, draft stays on tablet)
->yes;
:Task SUBMITTED, evidence stored by hash,
seal REPORT_SUBMITTED block;
|Regional Director|
:Review report and hash-verified photos
(GET /tasks/:id/report, GET /evidence/:sha256);
if (Field report supports?) then (retention: RETAIN or Level 1-2)
  :Keep household on the program
  (POST /tasks/:id/retain, grounds required);
  |Backend & Database|
  :Task VERIFIED_RETAIN, program_status = ACTIVE_COMPLIANT
  seal BENEFICIARY_RETAINED block, 180-day re-flag cooldown;
  stop
else (graduation: RECOMMEND_GRADUATION or Level 3)
  :Approve graduation, issue notice
  (POST /tasks/:id/resolve, grounds required);
endif
|Backend & Database|
:Task VERIFIED_GRADUATE, program_status = NOTICE_OF_INELIGIBILITY
seal BENEFICIARY_GRADUATED (notice), 15-day window, grants continue;
if (Appeal filed within 15 days?) then (yes)
  |Regional Director|
  :File appeal docket
  (POST /appeals/docket);
  |Backend & Database|
  :Seal APPEAL_FILED block, docket shows
  UNDER_APPEAL_HEARING, graduation blocked;
  |Regional Director|
  :Record hearing outcome on or after the hearing date
  (POST /appeals/:docket/decide);
  |Backend & Database|
  if (Outcome?) then (granted)
    :program_status = ACTIVE_COMPLIANT
    seal BENEFICIARY_RETAINED block, 180-day cooldown;
    stop
  else (denied)
    :program_status = GRADUATED
    seal BENEFICIARY_GRADUATED block;
    stop
  endif
else (no, window ended)
  |Regional Director|
  :Complete graduation
  (POST /beneficiaries/:id/graduate);
  |Backend & Database|
  :program_status = GRADUATED
  seal BENEFICIARY_GRADUATED block;
  stop
endif
@enduml
